          "date": "2026-11-07 08:31:43.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-20623 tests: allow sanity/27cg+27Ci server interop",
        "message": "LU-20623 tests: allow sanity/27cg+27Ci server interop\n\nSkip sanity.sh test_27cg with a pre-v2_15_54-2-g9e6225b2e7 server\nthat does not handle creating large overstriped files.\n\nSkip test_27Ci with a pre-v2_15_61-13-g90c093b785 server that is\nmissing component_add for overstriped layouts.\n\nAlso update the version checks in test_124g, test_134c and test_230k\nto the commits that added the needed server support, and fix the\ntest_119n skip messages.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity serverversion=2.16\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanity serverversion=2.15 env=ONLY=27,HONOR_EXCEPT=y\nFixes: 9e6225b2e738 (\"LU-14918 osd: don't declare similar ldiskfs writes twice\")\nFixes: 90c093b7850c (\"LU-17468 lod: component add missed pattern info\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I106feffbdb9a8bcd7fed75ac1b61459d8f3ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
